Row.Text:
Your Civilization is currently in its [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_APEX_AGE_TOOLTIP]Apex Age[/TIP]: a critical point of your people's identity. 
				[n]Civilizations in their Apex can train [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_UNIQUE_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Unique Units[/TIP], build unique Infrastructure, and study unique [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CIVIC_TOOLTIP]Civics[/TIP]. 
				[n]{1_nextAgeInfo}

You are currently playing a Time-Tested Civilization, which means your Civilization is not in its [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_APEX_AGE_TOOLTIP]Apex Age[/TIP].
				[n]While you do not have access to most of your Civilization's unique items, you still have [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CIVIC_TOOLTIP]Civics[/TIP] to study that are relevant to your Civilization.
				[n]{1_nextAgeInfo}
